{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_18","type":"agent_message","text":"The retry now uses the emitter’s fresh reflection key, and the engine resolves the response through the carried cursor cell. I’m checking what happens when execution continues into a new call, especially if another waiter still shares that cell."}}
